      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>/docs/dev/hashicorp/terraform/vars/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;p&gt;They are multiple variable levels as :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1: Environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2: File (terraform.tvars)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3: Json File (terraform.tfvars.json)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4: Auto File (*.auto.tfvars or *.auto.tfvars.json)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5: CLI (-var or var-file(&lt;em&gt;followed by the varfile.tfvars&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
